    "id": "a10000000000tab1",
    "type": "tab",
    "label": "Aloxy → Vercel dashboard",
    "disabled": false,
    "info": "Forwards Aloxy.Core data to the Vercel dashboard (/api/ingest).\nFed by a link-out node on the 'Aloxy HTTP Push to Modbus' tab (added by scripts/merge-node-red-flow.mjs).\nNeeds DASHBOARD_URL and INGEST_TOKEN env vars on the node-red container."
  },
  {
    "id": "a1000000000cmt01",
    "type": "comment",
    "z": "a10000000000tab1",
    "name": "1. Every update from Aloxy's flow (/aloxy pushes + start-up things.json) arrives here",
    "info": "",
    "x": 360,
    "y": 60,
    "wires": []
  },
